# What leaves is only drawn: the workspaces' sheet let go of (its scrim tapped), the bar's 文件 tapped under it as it
# sinks opens 文件; then the chat's own sheet ("…") let go of, and the composer tapped through it as it goes down
# takes the words, sent; nothing of the sheet was tapped on the way (no pin).
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap =Dev
until 切换 workspace
tapxy 195 120
# (60 ms into the sheet's going down: 文件 tapped under it as it sinks)
wait 60
now shot 1-sinking
now tap icon:folder
until =文件
gone 切换 workspace
shot 2-files
tap icon:chats
until 端到端测试
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
tap icon:more
until =固定到列表顶部
tapxy 195 60
# (60 ms into the sheet's going down: the composer tapped through it)
wait 60
now shot 3-going
now tapxy 120 -36
type 穿过下去的面板 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 穿过下去的面板 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 4-sent
log do: pins
# (the command beside the run reads the station's pins)
wait 1500
